  "body": "Currently UORSOBC is bound to the browsing context + active document, but it doesn't explain how non-active documents/windows should behave. Yet running scripts may have access to non-active documents/windows.\n\nI think UORSOBC should be bound to the window object (and renamed then somehow) and \n\"unit of related browsing contexts\" can stay as it is.\n",
